{"date":"2009-12-18","platform":"OVA","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/84/85/3495_c0iIg.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/84/85/3495_c0iIg.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/84/85/3495_c0iIg.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/84/85/3495_c0iIg.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/84/85/3495_c0iIg.jpg"},"summary":"秋日天空，或名秋色之空（あきそら），是日本漫画家糸杉柾宏的作品，双月刊《Champion RED Ichigo》第9期（2008年9月）开始连载，每期连载2话。单行本由秋田书店发行，本OAD为2009年12月18日发售的单行本第3卷所附赠。\r\n在《Champion RED Ichigo》第15期上公布了详细设定后，又于2009年12月号的《Champion RED》附录DVD中，收录了由饰演Aki的喜多村英梨担任旁白的先行PV；然而在同年10月26日，秋田书店官方网站突然宣布，将原定为Sora配音的声优从今井麻美更换为木下纱华，同时将Aki的声优从喜多村英梨更换为河原木志穗。\r\n虽然是没有对性器的直接描写的一般向作品，但还是包含了颇具感官刺激性的内容，可谓是接近一般向作品的下限。","name":"あきそら","name_cn":"秋日天空 OAD","tags":[{"name":"里番","count":451,"total_count":316495},{"name":"OVA","count":393,"total_count":365936},{"name":"姐弟恋","count":281,"total_count":444},{"name":"2009","count":198,"total_count":39409},{"name":"乱伦","count":184,"total_count":1069},{"name":"工口","count":164,"total_count":3626},{"name":"无底线一般向","count":138,"total_count":139},{"name":"一般向","count":136,"total_count":1234},{"name":"漫画改","count":129,"total_count":864948},{"name":"下限","count":74,"total_count":5071},{"name":"OAD","count":70,"total_count":35315},{"name":"HoodsEntertainment","count":64,"total_count":2035},{"name":"一般向你妹","count":53,"total_count":333},{"name":"無碼","count":40,"total_count":41},{"name":"漫改","count":39,"total_count":362014},{"name":"秋色","count":32,"total_count":33},{"name":"肉番","count":29,"total_count":32990},{"name":"akisora","count":27,"total_count":28},{"name":"全年龄","count":25,"total_count":241},{"name":"高桥丈夫","count":23,"total_count":528},{"name":"姐弟","count":20,"total_count":3193},{"name":"姐控","count":20,"total_count":3781},{"name":"下限帝","count":18,"total_count":18},{"name":"2009年12月","count":16,"total_count":126},{"name":"天空","count":14,"total_count":223},{"name":"纯爱","count":13,"total_count":39135},{"name":"百合"